  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Natogo Fresh Fish Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Fisheries. Fish processing and marketing, Beneficiaries: Thirty-seven (37) small scale fisher traders; of which 16 are women., Summary: The project funds will be used to provide cold storage space and additional markets for the fish traders; hire office staff; conduct good governance training; purchase accounting software and train staff in financial management; develop financial, human resources, and procurement policies; hire consultants to develop business and marketing plans; and purchase office equipment.</narrative>
  </description>
